{"id":"6e29245cada99db6","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-bounded-arithmetic-proof.md","title":"Bounded Arithmetic Proof","display":"df-bounded-arithmetic-proof — Bounded Arithmetic Proof","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-bounded-arithmetic-proof","aliases":["72-df-bounded-arithmetic-proof"],"display":"df-bounded-arithmetic-proof — Bounded Arithmetic Proof","depends_on":["[[72-df-bounded-arithmetic]]","[[72-df-i-delta-0]]","[[72-df-s2-theory]]","[[72-df-t2-theory]]"],"source_author":"Samuel R. Buss","source_chapter":"Samuel R. Buss, Chapter II, Proof Theory of Arithmetic, in Handbook of Proof Theory (1998)","source_sections":"§1.4–1.4.2","source_printed_pages":"109–111","source_pdf_pages":"121–123","source_pdf":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li\\[Studies in Logic and the Foundatio (2867)\\[Studies in Logic and the Found - libgen.li.pdf","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"round2_verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","revision_2026_10_22":"统一有界算术有限证明的孩子地址编码"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-bounded-arithmetic-proof"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-bounded-arithmetic-proof</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bounded-arithmetic-proof — Bounded Arithmetic Proof"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fb2b2dbad774692a\" href=\"?note=fb2b2dbad774692a\" title=\"72-df-bounded-arithmetic\">72-df-bounded-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0e5e75be5dd53241\" href=\"?note=0e5e75be5dd53241\" title=\"72-df-i-delta-0\">72-df-i-delta-0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"690ac0b5f3b63c49\" href=\"?note=690ac0b5f3b63c49\" title=\"72-df-s2-theory\">72-df-s2-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bde0adecda9b3967\" href=\"?note=bde0adecda9b3967\" title=\"72-df-t2-theory\">72-df-t2-theory</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_author","html":"Samuel R. Buss"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"Samuel R. Buss, Chapter II, Proof Theory of Arithmetic, in Handbook of Proof Theory (1998)"},{"key":"source_sections","html":"§1.4–1.4.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"109–111"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"121–123"},{"key":"source_pdf","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Studies in Logic and the Foundatio (2867)[Studies in Logic and the Found - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"revision_2026_10_22","html":"统一有界算术有限证明的孩子地址编码"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_T\\in\\{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A},\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\}\">\\(L_T\\in\\{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A},\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\}\\)</span> 是固定的一阶算术语言，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}(L_T)\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}(L_T)\\)</span> 是固定公理集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoundedTheory}_{L_T}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{BoundedTheory}_{L_T}(T)\\)</span> 成立，该谓词取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fb2b2dbad774692a\" href=\"?note=fb2b2dbad774692a\" title=\"72-df-bounded-arithmetic\">72-df-bounded-arithmetic</a> 的定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_T=\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L_T)\">\\(\\mathcal F_T=\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L_T)\\)</span>。本节已给出的输入包括 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\Delta_0,S_2^i,T_2^i,S_2,T_2\">\\(I\\Delta_0,S_2^i,T_2^i,S_2,T_2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\omega\">\\(i\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=\\langle\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathcal C},\\mathsf{Rules}_{\\mathcal C}\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal C=\\langle\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathcal C},\\mathsf{Rules}_{\\mathcal C}\\rangle\\)</span> 是固定完备经典一阶 finitary 演算的已实例化输入：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathcal C}\\subseteq\\mathcal F_T\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathcal C}\\subseteq\\mathcal F_T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rules}_{\\mathcal C}\\subseteq\\mathcal F_T^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathcal F_T\">\\(\\mathsf{Rules}_{\\mathcal C}\\subseteq\\mathcal F_T^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathcal F_T\\)</span>。规则关系包括自由变量与特征变量侧条件。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\subseteq\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(D\\subseteq\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 为有限节点集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\rangle\\)</span> 为根，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\frown\\langle j\\rangle\">\\(u\\frown\\langle j\\rangle\\)</span> 为附加 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 的子节点。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell:D\\to\\mathcal F_T\">\\(\\ell:D\\to\\mathcal F_T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\preceq v\">\\(u\\preceq v\\)</span> 为有限序列的前缀关系。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{enc}\">\\(\\mathsf{enc}\\)</span> 是固定的单射有限二进制证明编码，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{size}\">\\(\\mathsf{size}\\)</span> 是 Assertion 定义的编码长度函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\infty\">\\(\\infty\\)</span> 是大于全部自然数的附加元素。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}(L_T)\">\\(\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}(L_T)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{size}(\\pi):=|\\mathsf{enc}(\\pi)|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{size}(\\pi):=|\\mathsf{enc}(\\pi)|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{ArithProof}_{\\mathcal C}(T,D,\\ell)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\langle\\rangle\\in D\\land|D|&lt;\\omega\\land\\ell:D\\to\\mathcal F_T\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall v\\in D\\;\\forall u\\preceq v\\;(u\\in D)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall u\\in D\\;\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\n[\\{j\\in\\omega:u\\frown\\langle j\\rangle\\in D\\}=\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{14mm}\\land(m=0\\to(\\ell(u)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathcal C}\\cup T\\lor\\langle\\langle\\rangle,\\ell(u)\\rangle\\in\\mathsf{Rules}_{\\mathcal C}))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{14mm}\\land(m&gt;0\\to\\langle\\langle\\ell(u\\frown\\langle 0\\rangle),\\ldots,\\ell(u\\frown\\langle (m-1)\\rangle)\\rangle,\\ell(u)\\rangle\\in\\mathsf{Rules}_{\\mathcal C})],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{T,\\mathcal C}&amp;:=\\{\\langle D,\\ell\\rangle:\\mathsf{ArithProof}_{\\mathcal C}(T,D,\\ell)\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{concl}(\\langle D,\\ell\\rangle)&amp;:=\\ell(\\langle\\rangle)\\quad(\\langle D,\\ell\\rangle\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{T,\\mathcal C}),\\\\\nT\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}\\phi&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{T,\\mathcal C}\\;(\\mathsf{concl}(\\pi)=\\phi).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{ArithProof}_{\\mathcal C}(T,D,\\ell)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\langle\\rangle\\in D\\land|D|&lt;\\omega\\land\\ell:D\\to\\mathcal F_T\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall v\\in D\\;\\forall u\\preceq v\\;(u\\in D)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall u\\in D\\;\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\n[\\{j\\in\\omega:u\\frown\\langle j\\rangle\\in D\\}=\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{14mm}\\land(m=0\\to(\\ell(u)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathcal C}\\cup T\\lor\\langle\\langle\\rangle,\\ell(u)\\rangle\\in\\mathsf{Rules}_{\\mathcal C}))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{14mm}\\land(m&gt;0\\to\\langle\\langle\\ell(u\\frown\\langle 0\\rangle),\\ldots,\\ell(u\\frown\\langle (m-1)\\rangle)\\rangle,\\ell(u)\\rangle\\in\\mathsf{Rules}_{\\mathcal C})],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{T,\\mathcal C}&amp;:=\\{\\langle D,\\ell\\rangle:\\mathsf{ArithProof}_{\\mathcal C}(T,D,\\ell)\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{concl}(\\langle D,\\ell\\rangle)&amp;:=\\ell(\\langle\\rangle)\\quad(\\langle D,\\ell\\rangle\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{T,\\mathcal C}),\\\\\nT\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}\\phi&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{T,\\mathcal C}\\;(\\mathsf{concl}(\\pi)=\\phi).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mu_{T,\\mathcal C,\\mathsf{enc}}(\\phi):=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\min\\{\\mathsf{size}(\\pi):\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{T,\\mathcal C}\\land\\mathsf{concl}(\\pi)=\\phi\\},&amp;T\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}\\phi,\\\\\n\\infty,&amp;\\neg(T\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}\\phi).\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mu_{T,\\mathcal C,\\mathsf{enc}}(\\phi):=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\min\\{\\mathsf{size}(\\pi):\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{T,\\mathcal C}\\land\\mathsf{concl}(\\pi)=\\phi\\},&amp;T\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}\\phi,\\\\\n\\infty,&amp;\\neg(T\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}\\phi).\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ch. II §1.4，印刷 pp. 109–111（PDF pp. 121–123）给出算术的 sequent 证明和归纳规则。此处用有序有限标号树作通用表示；不是声称原书使用这套特定集合编码。</li>\n<li>原 Assertion 中整段自然语言条件现已形式化。演算、规则全部侧条件及编码是显式输入；证明长度不再是未指定编码的裸函数。</li>\n<li>本定义参数化于任意给定的有界算术公理集合，涵盖原 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\Delta_0+\\Omega_1\">\\(I\\Delta_0+\\Omega_1\\)</span> 的证明构造；该例中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega_1\">\\(\\Omega_1\\)</span> 尚无本目录定义，不能只凭这个名称实例化为闭合的具体理论。其专门节点仍列为未扩充，不因此收窄一般证明定义。</li>\n<li>空根叶可表示单公理证明；内部节点的子序列从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 连续编号，避免无序前提导致规则元数歧义。分支最小值仅在证明集合非空时取，另一分支显式返回 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\infty\">\\(\\infty\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>第二轮补全一般 finitary 规则可能有零前提的情况：叶也允许合法零前提规则的结论；结论投影只在已定义的证明集合上调用。没有额外假定给定演算的规则元数全部为正。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>2026-10-22：孩子地址统一为u串接单项序列，避免把自然数直接作为串接运算的序列参数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-bounded-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"fb2b2dbad774692a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-bounded-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-i-delta-0","status":"resolved","id":"0e5e75be5dd53241","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-i-delta-0]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-s2-theory","status":"resolved","id":"690ac0b5f3b63c49","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-s2-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-t2-theory","status":"resolved","id":"bde0adecda9b3967","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-t2-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-bounded-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"fb2b2dbad774692a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L_T\\in\\{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A},\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\}$ 是固定的一阶算术语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}(L_T)$ 是固定公理集合，$\\operatorname{BoundedTheory}_{L_T}(T)$ 成立，该谓词取 [[72-df-bounded-arithmetic]] 的定义；$\\mathcal F_T=\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L_T)$。本节已给出的输入包括 $I\\Delta_0,S_2^i,T_2^i,S_2,T_2$，$i\\in\\omega$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L_T\\in\\{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A},\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}(L_T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BoundedTheory}_{L_T}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F_T=\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L_T)","display":false},{"tex":"I\\Delta_0,S_2^i,T_2^i,S_2,T_2","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C=\\langle\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathcal C},\\mathsf{Rules}_{\\mathcal C}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathcal C}\\subseteq\\mathcal F_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Rules}_{\\mathcal C}\\subseteq\\mathcal F_T^{<\\omega}\\times\\mathcal F_T","display":false},{"tex":"D\\subseteq\\omega^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"u\\frown\\langle j\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell:D\\to\\mathcal F_T","display":false},{"tex":"u\\preceq v","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{enc}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{size}","display":false},{"tex":"\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}(L_T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{size}(\\pi):=|\\mathsf{enc}(\\pi)|.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{ArithProof}_{\\mathcal C}(T,D,\\ell)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n\\langle\\rangle\\in D\\land|D|<\\omega\\land\\ell:D\\to\\mathcal F_T\\\\\n&\\land\\forall v\\in D\\;\\forall u\\preceq v\\;(u\\in D)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall u\\in D\\;\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\n[\\{j\\in\\omega:u\\frown\\langle j\\rangle\\in D\\}=\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}\\\\\n&\\hspace{14mm}\\land(m=0\\to(\\ell(u)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathcal C}\\cup T\\lor\\langle\\langle\\rangle,\\ell(u)\\rangle\\in\\mathsf{Rules}_{\\mathcal C}))\\\\\n&\\hspace{14mm}\\land(m>0\\to\\langle\\langle\\ell(u\\frown\\langle 0\\rangle),\\ldots,\\ell(u\\frown\\langle (m-1)\\rangle)\\rangle,\\ell(u)\\rangle\\in\\mathsf{Rules}_{\\mathcal C})],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{T,\\mathcal C}&:=\\{\\langle D,\\ell\\rangle:\\mathsf{ArithProof}_{\\mathcal C}(T,D,\\ell)\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{concl}(\\langle D,\\ell\\rangle)&:=\\ell(\\langle\\rangle)\\quad(\\langle D,\\ell\\rangle\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{T,\\mathcal C}),\\\\\nT\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}\\phi&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{T,\\mathcal C}\\;(\\mathsf{concl}(\\pi)=\\phi).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mu_{T,\\mathcal C,\\mathsf{enc}}(\\phi):=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\min\\{\\mathsf{size}(\\pi):\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{T,\\mathcal C}\\land\\mathsf{concl}(\\pi)=\\phi\\},&T\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}\\phi,\\\\\n\\infty,&\\neg(T\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}\\phi).\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"I\\Delta_0+\\Omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\infty","display":false}],"bytes":4819,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-198","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-bounded-arithmetic-proof|df-bounded-arithmetic-proof — Bounded Arithmetic Proof]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-196","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[df-bounded-arithmetic-proof — Bounded Arithmetic Proof](72-df-bounded-arithmetic-proof.md)"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-212","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-bounded-arithmetic-proof|df-bounded-arithmetic-proof — Bounded Arithmetic Proof]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-42","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-bounded-arithmetic-proof]]"}],"outgoing":["fb2b2dbad774692a","0e5e75be5dd53241","690ac0b5f3b63c49","bde0adecda9b3967"]}